sequenceDiagram
  participant C as OCC / reconciler
  participant E as CredentialProxyDriver
  participant B as Sandbox
  participant F as Credential Proxy
  participant R as Resolver
  Note over C,R: Proposed flow, exact operations and cleanup survive restart
  C->>C: Commit denial and durable withdrawal intent
  C->>E: withdrawBinding(exact binding)
  E->>E: Persist tombstone<br/>Advance policy generation
  Note over E,B: Sandbox applies authenticated ProxyWiring<br/>Late installs cannot restore a tombstoned binding
  C->>E: wiringStatus
  E-->>C: Successor: remaining routes and bindings
  C->>B: applyCredentialProxy(successor, Command)
  C->>B: credentialProxyStatus for exact successor
  B-->>C: Receipt: binding set and policy generation
  C->>E: wiringStatus / inspect / reconcile
  E-->>C: Detached evidence or outstanding cleanup
  F->>C: RequestAuthorizer.check for next operation
  C-->>F: Deny withdrawn authority
  Note over C,F: Accepted final-check race remains, original deadlines bound in-flight work<br/>Logical denial, detach and provider revocation are distinct<br/>Revoke only if supported, no exported bearer recall or undo of sent effects
  opt Credential rejection
    F->>R: reportRejection
    R->>R: Authenticate receipt and exact material version
    alt Invalid or unauthorized feedback
      R-->>F: Refusal, no state change
    else Duplicate or obsolete feedback
      R-->>F: Recorded outcome or obsolete, no new work
    else New authenticated feedback
      R->>R: Durably commit dedup record and exact-version fence<br/>Include required coalesced recovery obligation
      Note over F,R: Static: no replacement approval<br/>Dynamic: owner handles recovery
      R-->>F: recorded, only after durable commit
    end
    Note over F,R: Exact source, grant, store, version<br/>Fence survives eviction / reread<br/>Late N cannot invalidate N+1<br/>or schedule its recovery
    F->>F: Return SafeResponse<br/>No automatic retry
  end
  Note over C,R: Unknown send / refresh / clone effects retain their original owner and attempt<br/>Known partial failure retains cleanup obligations, never blind replay
